{"id": 2345, "title": "Different Perspectives", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK3"], "slug": "different-perspectives", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/2345_different-perspectives.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["有两个妇人在聊天，其中一个问：“你儿子过得怎么样？”", "另外一个妇人难过地说：“不好，他实在是太可怜了，娶了个很懒的媳妇，不做饭、不洗衣服、不带孩子，每天只知道睡觉。我儿子还要把早饭拿到她的床上给她吃呢！”", "“那女儿呢？”那个妇人问。", "她高兴地说：“她嫁了一个不错的丈夫，从来不让她做家务，做饭、洗衣服、带孩子都是她丈夫做的，而且每天早上我女婿还会把早饭拿到床上给她吃呢！”", "多站在别人的角度看一看，或许你会有不同的看法。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["有兩個婦人在聊天，其中一個問：“你兒子過得怎麼樣？”", "另外一個婦人難過地說：“不好，他實在是太可憐了，娶了個很懶的媳婦，不做飯、不洗衣服、不帶孩子，每天只知道睡覺。我兒子還要把早飯拿到她的床上給她吃呢！”", "“那女兒呢？”那個婦人問。", "她高興地說：“她嫁了一個不錯的丈夫，從來不讓她做家務，做飯、洗衣服、帶孩子都是她丈夫做的，而且每天早上我女婿還會把早飯拿到床上給她吃呢！”", "多站在別人的角度看一看，或許你會有不同的看法。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["yǒu liǎng gè fù rén zài liáo tiān， qí zhōng yī gè wèn：“ nǐ ér zi guò de zěn me yàng？”", "lìng wài yī gè fù rén nán guò de shuō：“ bù hǎo， tā shí zài shì tài kě lián le， qǔ le gè hěn lǎn de xí fu， bù zuò fàn、 bù xǐ yī fu、 bù dài hái zi， měi tiān zhǐ zhī dào shuì jiào。 wǒ ér zi hái yào bǎ zǎo fàn ná dào tā de chuáng shàng gěi tā chī ne！”", "“ nà nǚ ér ne？” nà gè fù rén wèn。", "tā gāo xìng de shuō：“ tā jià le yī gè bù cuò de zhàng fu， cóng lái bù ràng tā zuò jiā wù， zuò fàn、 xǐ yī fu、 dài hái zi dōu shì tā zhàng fu zuò de， ér qiě měi tiān zǎo shang wǒ nǚ xu hái huì bǎ zǎo fàn ná dào chuáng shàng gěi tā chī ne！”", "duō zhàn zài bié rén de jiǎo dù kàn yī kàn， huò xǔ nǐ huì yǒu bù tóng de kàn fǎ。"], "english_paragraphs": ["Two women were chatting. One asked, “How is your son doing?”", "The other woman said sadly, “Not well. I feel so sorry for him. He married a very lazy woman who won’t cook, do laundry, or look after the children. All she does is sleep. My son even has to bring her breakfast in bed!”", "“What about your daughter?” the first woman asked.", "She said happily, “She married a wonderful man. He never makes her do housework. He does the cooking, the laundry, and the childcare. And every morning, my son-in-law even brings her breakfast in bed!”", "Try looking at things from someone else’s perspective more often. You might see them differently."], "english_full": "Two women were chatting. One asked, “How is your son doing?”\n\nThe other woman said sadly, “Not well. I feel so sorry for him. He married a very lazy woman who won’t cook, do laundry, or look after the children. All she does is sleep. My son even has to bring her breakfast in bed!”\n\n“What about your daughter?” the first woman asked.\n\nShe said happily, “She married a wonderful man. He never makes her do housework. He does the cooking, the laundry, and the childcare. And every morning, my son-in-law even brings her breakfast in bed!”\n\nTry looking at things from someone else’s perspective more often. You might see them differently.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu\" data-defn=\"to have; there is\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"liǎng\" data-defn=\"two / both / some / a few\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">两</span><span class=\"tr\">兩</span><rt>liǎng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"fù rén\" data-defn=\"married woman\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">妇人</span><span class=\"tr\">婦人</span><rt>fù rén</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zài\" data-defn=\"(used before a verb to indicate an action in progress)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"liáo tiān\" data-defn=\"to chat; to gossip\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">聊天</span><span class=\"tr\">聊天</span><rt>liáo tiān</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"qí zhōng\" data-defn=\"among / in / included among these\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">其中</span><span class=\"tr\">其中</span><rt>qí zhōng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wèn\" data-defn=\"to ask; to inquire\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">问</span><span class=\"tr\">問</span><rt>wèn</rt></ruby>：“<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nǐ\" data-defn=\"you\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ér zi\" data-defn=\"son\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">儿子</span><span class=\"tr\">兒子</span><rt>ér zi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"guò\" data-defn=\"to cross / to go over / to pass (time) / to celebrate (a holiday) / to live / to get along\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">过</span><span class=\"tr\">過</span><rt>guò</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"structural particle: used after a verb (or adjective as main verb), linking it to following phrase indicating effect, degree, possibility etc\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">得</span><span class=\"tr\">得</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zěn me yàng\" data-defn=\"how? / how about? / how was it? / how are things?\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">怎么样</span><span class=\"tr\">怎麼樣</span><rt>zěn me yàng</rt></ruby>？”", "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lìng wài\" data-defn=\"additional / separate / other\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">另外</span><span class=\"tr\">另外</span><rt>lìng wài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"fù rén\" data-defn=\"married woman\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">妇人</span><span class=\"tr\">婦人</span><rt>fù rén</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nán guò\" data-defn=\"to feel sad\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">难过</span><span class=\"tr\">難過</span><rt>nán guò</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"-ly / structural particle: used before a verb or adjective, linking it to preceding modifying adverbial adjunct\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">地</span><span class=\"tr\">地</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shuō\" data-defn=\"to speak; to talk; to say\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby>：“<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bù\" data-defn=\"no; not so\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hǎo\" data-defn=\"good / appropriate; proper\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"he; him; his\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shí zài\" data-defn=\"really / actually / indeed\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">实在</span><span class=\"tr\">實在</span><rt>shí zài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shì\" data-defn=\"indeed (used for emphasis)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tài\" data-defn=\"too (much) / very / extremely\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">太</span><span class=\"t