ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zuò fàn\" data-defn=\"to prepare a meal / to cook\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">做饭</span><span class=\"tr\">做飯</span><rt>zuò fàn</rt></ruby>、<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bù\" data-defn=\"no; not so\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xǐ\" data-defn=\"to wash; to bathe / to develop (photographs) / to shuffle (cards etc) / to erase (a recording)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">洗</span><span class=\"tr\">洗</span><rt>xǐ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī fu\" data-defn=\"clothes\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">衣服</span><span class=\"tr\">衣服</span><rt>yī fu</rt></ruby>、<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bù\" data-defn=\"no; not so\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dài\" data-defn=\"to look after / to raise\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">带</span><span class=\"tr\">帶</span><rt>dài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hái zi\" data-defn=\"child\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">孩子</span><span class=\"tr\">孩子</span><rt>hái zi</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"měi\" data-defn=\"each / every\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">每</span><span class=\"tr\">每</span><rt>měi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tiān\" data-defn=\"day\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">天</span><span class=\"tr\">天</span><rt>tiān</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhǐ\" data-defn=\"only; merely; just\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">只</span><span class=\"tr\">只</span><rt>zhǐ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhī dào\" data-defn=\"to know; to become aware of\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">知道</span><span class=\"tr\">知道</span><rt>zhī dào</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shuì jiào\" data-defn=\"to go to bed /