pression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chuáng\" data-defn=\"bed; couch (furniture that one can lie down on) / bed; bottom (of rivers, oceans, gardens etc) / frame; chassis\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">床</span><span class=\"tr\">床</span><rt>chuáng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shàng\" data-defn=\"(noun suffix) on; above\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">上</span><span class=\"tr\">上</span><rt>shàng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gěi\" data-defn=\"to / for / for the benefit of / to do sth (for sb)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">给</span><span class=\"tr\">給</span><rt>gěi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"she\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">她</span><span class=\"tr\">她</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chī\" data-defn=\"to eat; to consume / to eat at\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">吃</span><span class=\"tr\">吃</span><rt>chī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ne\" data-defn=\"(discourse particle) used to mark a slight pause or emphasis in speech\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">呢</span><span class=\"tr\">呢</span><rt>ne</rt></ruby>！”", "“<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nà\" data-defn=\"(specifier) that; the; those / (pronoun) that (referring to persons, things or situations)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">那</span><span class=\"tr\">那</span><rt>nà</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nǚ ér\" data-defn=\"daughter\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">女儿</span><span class=\"tr\">女兒</span><rt>nǚ ér</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ne\" data-defn=\"(discourse particle) used to mark a slight pause or emphasis in speech\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">呢</span><span class=\"tr\">呢</span><rt>ne</rt></ruby>？”<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nà\" data-defn=\"(specifier) that; the